## Frontend environment variables
#
# If you DO NOT set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL, the frontend will call relative `/api/*`
# and Next.js will proxy those calls to `http://localhost:5000` in `next.config.js`.
#
# For deployments (Vercel/Render/custom domain), set this to your backend origin:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
#
# Local dev alternative (no proxy needed):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000

